{"id":"659251","name":"客家艾叶焖鸡饭","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/659251/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土鸡","amount":"半只"},{"name":"干艾叶","amount":"15g"},{"name":"大米","amount":"250g"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜末","amount":"20g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡肉剁成块。","img":"images/659251/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"三蒸三晒的艾草非常香，用清水泡软，洗去灰尘杂质。","img":"images/659251/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"大米淘洗干净，用纯净水泡30分钟左右。","img":"images/659251/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"姜末、葱花。","img":"images/659251/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"起锅烧油，爆香姜末。","img":"images/659251/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入鸡肉。","img":"images/659251/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"炒干水分，加适量的盐入味。","img":"images/659251/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入泡好的大米。","img":"images/659251/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入切碎的艾叶。","img":"images/659251/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入酱油和蚝油调味。","img":"images/659251/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"准备一口砂锅，锅内均匀的刷上油。","img":"images/659251/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"热一下锅，倒入米饭。","img":"images/659251/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入与米饭齐平的水。","img":"images/659251/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"焖7~8分钟左右，用筷子扎孔透气。","img":"images/659251/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"继续焖10分钟。","img":"images/659251/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"时间到，饭熟了。","img":"images/659251/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"关火，撒上葱花再焖上2分钟。","img":"images/659251/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。散寒除湿，补气养血。","img":"images/659251/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}